BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314477911@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260702T041050Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T110000
SUMMARY:🥾 Let's Hike!! Jockey Hollow 
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nLet's celebrate the nation's semiquincentennial 
 (can you pronounce that?)\n\nCome hike with us in the Morristown National 
 Historic Park. We'll do about 3 miles along the Grand Parade loop\, see a 
 colonial era house and garden\, and Revolutionary War soldier hut (replica
 s). It's a little like traveling back in time 250 years\n\n[AllTrails: Gra
 nd Parade Loop](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/new-jersey/grand-parade
 -trail?u=i&sh=vgtzxk)\n\n**PLEASE NOTE THIS WALK IS AT 09:30**\n**Please a
 rrive 5 minutes early so we can start on time.**\n\nWe've scouted these tr
 ails and find them appropriate for most of our members. If you've walked w
 ith us at Eagle Rock\, this is similar in difficulty with just a little mo
 re up and down. There may be wet or muddy sections and a few rocks and tre
 e roots. Please wear hiking boots/shoes and bring trekking poles or a walk
 ing stick\, if you prefer.\n\nDon't forget your water!\n\nInclement weathe
 r may cancel this event. Please check the event page for comments prior to
  leaving for the meetup.\n\n**Disclaimer:** If you join this event\, pleas
 e understand that you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-b
 eing and will hold no one else liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314477911/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260425T182648Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260425T182648Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314515730@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260702T041050Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260710T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260710T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314515730/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260427T213226Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T213226Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
